notes.content:
Hi everyone again! Let's try new 1.03 version of this game. What changed?

[list]
[*] Crashes are minimized;
[*] The graphical API was changed to DirectX 11. In this regard, the system requirements were updated;
[*] Optimization work has been done. FPS increased by about 2-3 times. The first few seconds of descent, the game analyzes your system and generates the appropriate meshes, and lags are observed during this time;
[*] Added information about the current depth to the interface;
[*] Added the ability to turn off the interface so that you can take beautiful screenshots. Press [F] to do this.
[/list]

I hope you'll enjoy this. I also ask people who have written a negative review on a page in the store for technical reasons to reconsider their opinion.

And, of course, if you like the game, do not forget to buy the soundtrack to support the author.
